# Environment variables template for the VT SASE website.
#
# HOW TO USE:
#   1. Copy this file to `.env.local`  ->  cp .env.example .env.local
#   2. Fill in real values in `.env.local` (that file is gitignored and never committed).
#
# NEVER put real secrets, API keys, or passwords in THIS file — it is committed to git.
# Add new variables here (with an empty value or a placeholder) so other committee
# members know what they need to set up.
#
# Next.js note: variables that need to be readable in the browser MUST be prefixed
# with NEXT_PUBLIC_ (e.g. NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL). Everything else stays server-only.

# Example (uncomment and set in your .env.local):
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=
